  "title": "Italian Pan-Fried Chicken Thighs with Creamy Tomato Sauce",
  "description": "This Italian pan-fried chicken thighs with creamy tomato sauce recipe browns chicken thighs and serves them in a spinach-tomato sauce. It's quick to make.",
